  "notes": "Poznote notes app. Distinctive: grey (#f8f9fa) icon rail + sidebar against white content; single blue accent (#007db8) for active tab top border, search toggles and Projects folder icon; amber bell for notifications. Toolbar is a centered row of ten line icons with no labels. Tags shown as pill tokens with bold ×. Code blocks are light grey rounded boxes with a small uppercase language chip and faint icon controls (collapse, wrap, line numbers, copy). Folder counts in tiny grey pills. Small edge toggles (‹) collapse sidebar columns; floating stacked square buttons bottom-right for view/visibility/focus mode."
